    "body": "So this looks like an upstream issue, the battery crate is reporting that the battery at 75%\n```\n...\n[DEBUG] - (starship::modules::battery): Battery found: Battery { impl: MacOSDevice { source: PowerSource { io_object: IoObject(10243) } }, vendor: Some(\"DSY\"), model: Some(\"bq40z651\"), serial_number: None, technology: Unknown, state: Charging, capacity: 0.9783845, temperature: Some(302.75 K^1), percentage: 0.75732553, cycle_count: Some(47), energy: 295054.53 m^2 kg^1 s^-2, energy_full: 389600.66 m^2 kg^1 s^-2, energy_full_design: 398208.13 m^2 kg^1 s^-2, energy_rate: 47.114502 m^2 kg^1 s^-3, voltage: 12.584001 m^2 kg^1 s^-3 A^-1, time_to_full: Some(4500.0 s^1), time_to_empty: None }\n[DEBUG] - (starship::modules::battery): Battery status: BatteryStatus { percentage: 75.73255, state: Charging }\n...\n```",
