    "updated_at": "2025-01-23T18:26:38Z",
    "body": "This is a very old issue, but I would like to comment to state that this has since been resolved [upstream](https://github.com/svartalf/rust-battery/issues/8). The current latest version of the battery crate is [0.7.8](https://crates.io/crates/battery). However, still occurs in Starship. Example:\n\n<img width=\"1511\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1055c212-c98d-48be-9ef4-990e438c8f3b\" />\n\nI see an open issue exists [here](https://github.com/starship/rust-battery). Should we move this discussion there?",
